        <mxCell id="notes_now" value="Edge: CloudFront (OAC) + private, versioned S3 bucket&#10;Identity: Cognito User Pool (Lite), password + SRP auth, stall-owner/admin groups&#10;API: one HTTP API, Cognito JWT default authorizer, public catalog reads opt out&#10;Compute: 6 Lambdas, least-privilege IAM per function, reserved-concurrency bulkheads, X-Ray&#10;Data: one DynamoDB table, on-demand, 2 GSIs, Streams, TTL, point-in-time recovery&#10;Events: 2 SQS queues with DLQs (maxReceive 3), fed by the stream via the Dispatcher&#10;Ops: 14-day log retention, 5 CloudWatch alarms per stage, SSM-configurable order TTL" style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#101826;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="768" width="650" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

