        <mxCell id="notes_next" value="CI/CD: GitHub Actions + OIDC deploy role, dev &#8594; approval &#8594; prod&#10;Edge hardening: WAF on CloudFront; custom domain + ACM (needed for TLS 1.2+ at the edge)&#10;Access logs: S3, CloudFront and API Gateway access logging&#10;Key management: customer-managed KMS keys in place of AWS-managed keys" style="text;html=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#101826;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
